    "updated_at": "2023-10-20T19:00:43Z",
    "body": "I'll second everything @tabatkins says.\r\n\r\nUsing [popover](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Global_attributes/popover) might be the way to go. I noticed that the MUI components don't use this. It might be worth filing an issue with them.\r\n\r\nI'll close this because the the spec is working as intended, and this issue does not represent a specific issue around the spec. We can continue to discuss it though, and if you feel like there is a specific issue around the spec we can always re-open or file a new issue about that.\r\n\r\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
